  "title": "Uncompromising Design",
  "content_html": "<main class=\"p-page\">\n      <div class=\"l-container-fluid\">\n      <ul class=\"c-breadcrumb\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/BreadcrumbList\"><li class=\"c-breadcrumb__item\" itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\"><a itemprop=\"item\" href=\"https://rebooth.co.jp\"><span itemprop=\"name\" >HOME</span></a><meta itemprop=\"position\" content=\"1\" /></li><li class=\"c-breadcrumb__item\" itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\"><a itemprop=\"item\" href=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/why-choose-us/\"><span itemprop=\"name\">Reasons for Selection</span></a><meta itemprop=\"position\" content=\"2\" /></li><li class=\"c-breadcrumb__item\" itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\"><span itemprop=\"name\">Uncompromising Design</span><meta itemprop=\"position\" content=\"3\" /></li></ul>    </div>\n    <section class=\"p-page__header\">\n      <div class=\"l-container-fluid\">\n        <div class=\"p-page__title c-title-sec \">\n          <small class=\"p-page__parent-title p-page__title--fade\">Reasons for Selection</small>\n          <p class=\"c-text--en js-split\">\n            why choose us          </p>\n          <h1 class=\"c-text--ja p-page__title--fade\">Uncompromising Design</h1>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n                      <div class=\"p-page__thumbnail\">\n          <div class=\"u-media g-thumbnail\">\n            <img src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/choose.2.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n          </div>\n        </div>\n          </section>\n  \n\n  <div class=\"wp_block-content\">\n    \n<div class=\"wp-block-group p-page-column-box alignwide is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group p-page-column-box__header is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading is-decorated-top\">Expanding Booth Expression with High Freedom Using a Truss Structure</h2>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group p-page-column-box__body is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Re:Booth (Re:ブース) allows for flexible shapes by utilizing trusses for the framework, and can also accommodate hanging monitors.<br>We accommodate various exhibition booth designs according to your requests while combining reusable materials such as display panels and display stands.<br>By leveraging reusable materials, it is possible to create booths tailored to the scale and objectives of the exhibition.<br></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-video p-section-video\"><video height=\"1080\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1920 / 1080;\" width=\"1920\" autoplay loop muted src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/rebooth-movie-02.mp4\" playsinline></video></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-1a05964e wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"960\" height=\"679\" src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/854dd6a31e0352bef2c4a276173fa86c-960x679.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-515\" style=\"aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/854dd6a31e0352bef2c4a276173fa86c-960x679.jpg 960w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/854dd6a31e0352bef2c4a276173fa86c-1920x1358.jpg 1920w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/854dd6a31e0352bef2c4a276173fa86c-450x318.jpg 450w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/854dd6a31e0352bef2c4a276173fa86c-768x543.jpg 768w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/854dd6a31e0352bef2c4a276173fa86c-1536x1086.jpg 1536w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/854dd6a31e0352bef2c4a276173fa86c-2048x1448.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" /></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/191011-NA-BLUE001-960x640.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-516\" style=\"aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/191011-NA-BLUE001-960x640.jpg 960w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/191011-NA-BLUE001-1920x1280.jpg 1920w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/191011-NA-BLUE001-450x300.jpg 450w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/191011-NA-BLUE001-768x512.jpg 768w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/191011-NA-BLUE001-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/191011-NA-BLUE001-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" /></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">By combining multiple display panels, we flexibly produce booths according to the scale of the exhibition.<br>Since three-dimensional booths using trusses for the framework are also possible, you can aim for a highly designed exhibition space while using versatile materials.<br></p>\n    <div class=\"p-archive-list__link\">\n              <div class=\"p-page__list\">\n                      <a class=\"p-page__card\" href=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/why-choose-us/reuse/\">\n\n              <div class=\"p-page-card__header\">\n                <div class=\"p-page-card__thumbnail u-media\">\n                                                          <img src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/choose.3-450x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                                  </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"p-page-card__body\">\n                <h3 class=\"p-page-card__title\">Design Capabilities Based on Reuse</h3>\n                <div class=\"p-page-card__excerpt\">\n                  Reducing Environmental Impact with Reusable Materials In Japan, approximately 700 exhibitions are held annually, and many companies set up booths for just a few days of participation. Conventional wooden booths are often dismantled and disposed of after the event, creating a significant burden [&amp;hellip;]                </div>\n              </div>\n            </a>\n                      <a class=\"p-page__card\" href=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/why-choose-us/reduces-costs/\">\n\n              <div class=\"p-page-card__header\">\n                <div class=\"p-page-card__thumbnail u-media\">\n                                                          <img src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/640788444-450x253.jpeg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                                  </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"p-page-card__body\">\n                <h3 class=\"p-page-card__title\">Balancing Exhibition Costs and Environmental Impact</h3>\n                <div class=\"p-page-card__excerpt\">\n                  A System That Lowers Exhibition Costs the More You Use It Conventional exhibition booths often incur significant costs each time because design, drafting, and layout adjustments are all outsourced to contractors. Re:Booth not only reuses materials but also allows the design and layout [&amp;hellip;]                </div>\n              </div>\n            </a>\n          \n        </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n\n\n</main>",
